    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín sandakmoó alqado oo Mungú nguna dahaasiyé', ngway qaasiyé' baraá heémadá' Daudi aa amohhe'eés as inós. Inooín ilahhooár da/a nee ar wayduuwo kay haniís dír geeraá Mungú. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alaá Daudi ilahhooár da/a nee ar wayduuwo ngiwa hhe'eés hanisaro, muu guri tsuúq ar umuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Israeli sleémeero guri muruú /aymár i qasimiís, hhawaate nee /ameenaaro, umuú heewo guna qáy ar mukaatmo nee fu'uniro nee mukaatmoó taa tleéhh ar sabiíbuú kaaharén.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi múk tlahhoó Laáwi guna ádbáy niwa gadiyuusiya' geeraá sandakmoó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ wa ale, nee as kuwa firiirin nee kuwa sluufmiisi, nee kuwa xirfayemisi AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asafu kuna geeraharusmooín wa tsawaár, nee Sekaria tay ale/isusmoowós, múk mariímba nee gidaandooriro gi slahhaám a kwí: Yeieli, nee Shemiramoti, nee Yeieli nee Matitiya, nee Eliabu, nee Benaya, nee Obed-edomu nee Yehieli. Asafu an heé mitingiraay gwaa slahhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaahamuusér Mungú Benaya nee Yahasieli tarumbeéta ngina ufahhané' geeraá sandakmoó alqadór Mungú wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalaarí a deelór hargeera ar Daudi Asafu nee hhaeewós ngiwa tsawaár as AAKOÓ MUNGÚ nguwa xirfayeemisiya' ar daa'aangw.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo muu sleémeero iri oó', «Amin», Aakoó Mungú kuri xirfayeemiís.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Daudi Asafu nee hhaeewós giri dír geeraá sandakmoó alqadór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ i máy, niwa didá' wa gadiyuusiya' as umuú baalaaro gadiyér hariim ngiwa tleehhiya'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sleeme Obed-edomu garmoó Yedutuni dinkwa nee hhaeewós awa mibeeri lahhoó' nee dakaát mukdá' nguna ale/iimisiyé'. Qoomaarihe sleeme Obed-edomu garmoó Yedutuni nee Hosa a hara xuumuusér afkú do'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Daudi kaahamusmo Sadoki nee hhaeewós kudaá kaahamuuse gina máy tawa gadiyuusi geeraá heémár AAKOÓ MUNGÚ wa ale, tidár didá' gáwtí dirii' baraá Gibeoniro, didár ilahhooa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as umuú matlaatle nee tsiindoowo ilahhooár da/a/aangw ngiwa hanmisiya' dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ gawaá kitángw ilahhooár da/a/aangw, ar adoodá' kara gooín baraá hara'ayár AAKOÓ MUNGUHE, tidá' aa oó' dír múk Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín a dinkwa nee Hemani nee Yedutuni nee mukduú hatlá' taa tsawaár, kudá' umer'ín taa oó' as AAKOÓ MUNGÚ nguwa sluufmisiya' as sla'aarirós tidá' warqawaaká ay kureeri sleém. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hemani nee Yedutuni i tarumbeétadaá koná' nee mitingiraywo, as kiwa slahhan, nee xooslaá daa'ango as daa'ángw hhohhó' kuwa daai. Daaqoó Yedutuni kuna xuumuusér afér gixsár wa qaás.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
